{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"artibody\">&#13;\n                        <p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2025/1108/aeef4ca7151c05e.jpg\"></p><p>聯邦快遞在致命空難後決定退役其MD-11機隊，但聯邦快遞表示，計劃在本月晚些時候，待其28架MD-11飛機符合波音維護要求後，恢復該機隊的運營。</p>                        </div>&#13;\n                    </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-11T19:52:14.531375+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}